.subckt cml2cmos INP INN IREF CK VDD VSS
*.ipin INP
*.ipin INN
*.ipin IREF
*.opin CK
*.iopin VDD
*.iopin VSS
XQT tail IREF te VSS npn13G2v Nx=4 El=1
RT te VSS 600 m=1
