XP2 cmo d1 VDD VDD sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XI1 cmo cmob VDD VSS inv_hv
XI2 cmob CK VDD VSS inv_hv
.ends

* expanding   symbol:  inv_hv.sym # of pins=4
